# TypeScript incremental-build stamps — written by `tsc -b` even with noEmit: true
*.tsbuildinfo

# Local agent/IDE tool state. These hide behind their own nested .gitignore files today, so the
# protection lives inside the tool and disappears in a fresh clone. Name them here instead.
.kilo/
.fallow/

# NOTE: `vite.config.js` / `vite.config.d.ts` are deliberately NOT ignored. `tsconfig.node.json`
# now sets noEmit so they are never generated; if one ever appears it means something is emitting
# a config that shadows vite.config.ts, and it should be LOUD in `git status`, then deleted.
